  "signatureHoleDescription": "Hole 7 is the longest at Lakewood Hills at 368 feet — a front-nine par 3 that asks for a full midrange off the rolling hills before the back nine's woods take over. It's the hole that hints at what's coming and the one that keeps first-timers coming back.",
